(404)\n- For CANCELLED status: throws ConflictException with SHIPMENT_CANNOT_BE_CONFIRMED (409)\n- For CONFIRMED status: returns existing shipment unchanged (idempotent)\n- For CREATED status: creates a copy with CONFIRMED status, saves it, returns it\n\n**ShipmentControllerTest.kt** - Added 4 test methods covering:\n- Happy path: CREATED → CONFIRMED transition\n- Idempotent: second confirm call on CONFIRMED shipment\n- Conflict: confirming CANCELLED shipment returns 409\n- Not found: confirming non-existent shipment returns 404\n\nAll tests use the established MockMvc pattern with status and jsonPath assertions.\n\n**Unresolved findings:** None. All requirements are satisfied.\n\n```\n<<PHASE:DONE>>\n```\n\n**Requirement** — Add POST /shipments/{shipmentId}/confirm endpoint that confirms a created shipment, supports idempotent retries, rejects cancelled shipments with 409, and non-existent shipments with 404.\n\n**Changed:**\n- `ApiError.kt` — Added SHIPMENT_CANNOT_BE_CONFIRMED error code for the 409 conflict case\n- `ShipmentController.kt` — Added confirm(shipmentId) endpoint that transitions CREATED → CONFIRMED, handles idempotent CONFIRMED requests, rejects CANCELLED with 409, and non-existent with 404\n- `ShipmentControllerTest.kt` — Added 4 test cases covering the happy path, idempotent retry, cancelled conflict, and not-found scenarios\n\n**Tests:**\n- \"confirms a CREATED shipment and transitions to CONFIRMED\" — Verifies status changes from CREATED to CONFIRMED\n- \"confirming an already CONFIRMED shipment succeeds without error\" — Verifies idempotent retry does not fail\n- \"confirming a CANCELLED shipment is rejected with 409 Conflict\" — Verifies 409 response with correct error code\n- \"confirming a non-existent shipment is rejected with 404 Not Found\" — Verifies 404 response with correct error code\n\n**Verification** — Command: `./mvnw test` from sample-service directory. Result: BUILD SUCCESS with 17 tests passing (0 failures, 0 errors).\n\n**Not done** — Nothing. All acceptance criteria satisfied, all tests passing, no files modified outside shipment feature scope."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4789,"cache_read_input_tokens":19060,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4789},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6edb97ea-277b-4b68-96ef-0c9bdbad94a0","uuid":"ee7a860e-a72a-4cc4-8225-897cd1bc9515","timestamp":"2026-09-09T08:17:24.489Z","request_id":"req_011CesXzz39zP3L9x9AS8m3w"}
